      "content": "The neoliberal trade model, with its emphasis on deregulation and deep integration, has failed to deliver on its promises of economic prosperity for all. It has instead led to a decoupling of productivity from wages, resulting in massive wealth concentration and increased inequality. This model has undermined national economic resilience and social cohesion, making it clear that a shift towards more protectionist or \"worker-centric\" trade policies is not just a political choice, but an economic necessity. By prioritizing the well-being of workers and communities, we can create a more equitable and sustainable economic system that benefits everyone.",
